warning[min_max]: this is always `0`: the bounds are swapped
  --> tests/lint/min_max/bad.jai:5:10
   |
 5 |     a := min(0, max(100, x));
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: to keep a value between 0 and 100, write `clamp(value, 0, 100)`
   = note: `min_max` is `warn` by default

warning[min_max]: this is always `100`: the bounds are swapped
  --> tests/lint/min_max/bad.jai:6:10
   |
 6 |     b := max(100, min(x, 0));
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: to keep a value between 0 and 100, write `clamp(value, 0, 100)`
   = note: `min_max` is `warn` by default

